     {
       "id": "box_rural_morning_rate_constants",
       "description": "Every thermal rate coefficient of RADM2 at the rural morning: T = 288 K, M = 2.39e19, RH 0.80 box state, against RCONST(22:156) of the WRF-conform KPP Update_RCONST (radm2_Update_Rconst.f90 generated by KPP 2.1 from radm2.eqn, compiled real64 with gfortran 13.3 in the WRF build container; standalone box driver data/eqwefic/chem_build/driver, dump /projects/illinois/eng/cee/ctessum/ctessum/data/eqwefic/dumps/radm2/box_rural_morning.json). Pointwise, no time step. Expected agreement is binary64 round-off (the same double-precision arithmetic in both), so the tolerance is the CLAUDE.md double-precision contract rel 1e-9; the single-precision literals of radm2.eqn (.20946e0, .78084, -2.3) are bound as their binary64 values so no rounding residual remains. The one exception is k_R043 (N2O5 + aerosol water, rc_n2o5), which WRF evaluates in SINGLE precision in kpp_mechd_ibu_radm2.inc: tolerance rel 1e-6 (measured residual ~1e-7). There is no WRF-Chem run behind these states; they are typical mixing-ratio boxes (make_states.py).",
       "parameter_overrides": {
         "T": 288.0,
         "M_air": 2.3888063901580513e+19,
         "RH": 0.8,
         "j_no2": 0.002975,
         "j_o31d": 1.12e-05,
         "j_o33p": 0.000147,
         "j_hno2": 0.0005949999999999999,
         "j_hno3": 2.275e-07,
         "j_hno4": 1.4699999999999997e-06,
         "j_no3o2": 0.00805,
         "j_no3o": 0.06475,
         "j_h2o2": 2.555e-06,
         "j_ch2om": 1.61e-05,
         "j_ch2or": 1.085e-05,
         "j_ch3cho": 1.9249999999999998e-06,
         "j_ch3o2h": 1.89e-06,
         "j_ch3coch3": 2.3799999999999996e-07,
         "j_ch3coo2h": 1.1199999999999999e-06,
         "j_ch3coc2h5": 5.599999999999999e-07,
         "j_hcocho": 3.85e-05,
         "j_hcochob": 7.349999999999999e-06,
         "j_ch3cocho": 5.6e-05,
         "j_hcochest": 7.7e-05,
         "j_ch3ono2": 3.85e-07
       },
       "expression_template_imports": [
         {
           "ref": "./tests/box_rural_morning_rate_constants_inputs.esm"
         }
       ],
       "time_span": {
         "start": 0,
         "end": 1
       },
       "tolerance": {
         "rel": 1e-09
       },
       "assertions": [
         {
